{"id":"wb-7-1339","name":"巴巴寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"巴巴寺","text":"巴巴寺是位于四川省阆中市盘龙山的中国苏非派嘎德忍耶教门的清真寺，文物遗址年代判定为清。1996年9月16日公布为四川省第四批省级文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%B4%E5%B7%B4%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93019607,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93019607","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/74c5107a9d3e6bcd4e9bb320.jpg","title":"四川閬中清真巴巴寺_Baba_Mosque,_Sichuan_(55027736665).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D%E9%96%AC%E4%B8%AD%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%B7%B4%E5%B7%B4%E5%AF%BA_Baba_Mosque,_Sichuan_(55027736665).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D%E9%96%AC%E4%B8%AD%E6%B8%85%E7%9C%9F%E5%B7%B4%E5%B7%B4%E5%AF%BA_Baba_Mosque%2C_Sichuan_%2855027736665%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Dust Chan 塵寞賢","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​四川閬中清真巴巴寺","width":320,"height":213}}